# the world's events: rain (everything grows fast, the hats patter), frost (the weak wither), an empty garden seeds
# itself, bees make hybrids with two parents, the gardener keeps busy, moods move
wait 300
weather 2
wait 2000
expect rains 1
expect weather 2
expect par3 0
shot rain.png
wait 30000
expect sixteenths >10
weather 0
wait 1000
# a frost: sprouts wither
weather 3
wait 1000
expect frosts 1
expect stage2 0
shot frost.png
weather 0
# nothing growing: within a minute a seed blows in over the wall
clear
wait 60000
expect wild >0
expect living >0
shot wild.png
# Quick, an hour and a half: bees cross flowers (hybrids, two parents), rabbits nibble, the gardener tends
tap HOME
spin K2 2
wait 5400000
expect hybrids >0
expect lineage >0
expect nibbles >0
expect tended >20
expect day >5
expect living >0
shot later.png
tap SEQ
wait 300
shot ledger.png
# after all that growing, the garden still saves and loads whole
tap SAVE
wait 20
snap
reboot
expect same 1
